<title>UK: Council of Europe ups bond to 22 billion pesetas.</title>
<headline>Council of Europe ups bond to 22 billion pesetas.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following callable bond has been increased by lead manager J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COUNCIL OF EUROPE</p>
<p> AMT   **22 BLN ESP   COUPON    *5.25	MATURITY   *25.NOV.11</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE *100.475   PAY DATE    25.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     LISTING    AIAF	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p>DENOMS (K) 100</p>
<p>NOTES  *CALLABLE AFTER FIVE YEARS AT 113.992</p>
<p>		CALLABLE AFTER SEVEN YEARS AT 122.251</p>
<p>		REPAYABLE AFTER 15 YEARS AT 171.171</p>
<p>		** ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 10 BLN ESP ON 22.OCT.96,</p>
<p>		INCREASED BY FIVE BILLION ESP ON WEDNESDAY</p>
<p>		-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
